Hello all!  This is a port of Larn v12.0 to VAX/VMS.  Now everyone can save
his/her daughter!!  Just unpack using /bin/sh and read readme.txt.

                                                - Mark Nagel

P.S.  Thanks to Lord Kahless for letting me post this!



